handlers.lua and serializer.lua in this folder are CETBridge's game handlers and value serializer, copied unmodified
from Guikingone/WkMCP (live-bridge/CETBridge, commit 6f6be2fb74f3c4786fc49c205af4104e32ae27c2), which took them from
Y4rd13/cyber-engine-tweak-mcp (cet-mod/CETBridge, commit 4893237b5d181c7d1e0bd8638035a56b1bf607fc) and fixed set_stat,
spawn_vehicle, added unobserve_events and probe. Both are MIT licensed:

